("Dentex","Zubatac","Zobatec"),
("zubatac","Dentex dentex","Dentex dentex"),
("Dentex sit deeper on the slope; slow jigging works best.","Zubaci stoje dublje na padini; najbolje radi sporo jigiranje.","Zobatci stojijo globlje na pobočju; najbolje deluje počasno jigiranje."),
("Moving water gets the bait schools going, and dentex hunt the drop-offs.","Pokretna voda pokreće jata sitne ribe, a zubaci love na padinama.","Gibanje vode spodbudi jate drobne ribe, zobatci pa lovijo na strminah."),
("Activity slows; work the deeper edges.","Aktivnost slabi; lovite dublje rubove.","Aktivnost upade; lovite na globljih robovih."),
("Current on the points and drop-offs switches dentex on.","Struja na rtovima i padinama aktivira zubace.","Tok na rtičih in strminah zobatce aktivira."),
("Steep rocky points are where dentex ambush bait at first light.","Na strmim stjenovitim rtovima zubaci u zoru vrebaju sitnu ribu.","Na strmih skalnatih rtičih zobatci ob zori prežijo na drobno ribo."),
("Rocky drop-offs with current are prime dentex ground.","Stjenovite padine sa strujom vrhunska su pozicija za zubaca.","Skalnate strmine s tokom so odlično lovišče za zobatca."),
("Dentex patrol the 12–20 m shelf after bait schools and squid.","Zubaci obilaze plato na 12–20 m za jatima sitne ribe i lignjama.","Zobatci patruljirajo po planoti na 12–20 m za jatami drobne ribe in lignji."),
("Deeper rock and rubble holds the bigger dentex.","Dublje kamenje i šljunak drže veće zubace.","Globlje skale in grušč skrivajo večje zobatce."),
("Dentex come close to rocky shore only at first light.","Zubaci prilaze stjenovitoj obali samo u zoru.","Zobatci se skalnati obali približajo le ob zori."),
("Minimum size 30 cm; up to 20% of the dentex you keep (by weight) may be 25–30 cm.","Minimalna veličina 30 cm; do 20% zadržanih zubaca (po masi) smije biti 25–30 cm.","Najmanjša velikost 30 cm; do 20% obdržanih zobatcev (po masi) je lahko 25–30 cm."),
("Bonito","Palamida","Palamida"),
