("Open water 18–25 m deep: where bonito schools travel along the coast.","Otvoreno more dubine 18–25 m: tuda jata palamida putuju uz obalu.","Odprto morje globine 18–25 m: tu jate palamid potujejo ob obali."),
("Bonito chase bait over the shelf, often breaking the surface.","Palamide tjeraju sitnu ribu nad platoom, često izbijajući na površinu.","Palamide podijo drobno ribo nad planoto in pogosto razbijajo površino."),
("Schools follow the edge of the slope at dawn.","Jata u zoru prate rub padine.","Jate ob zori sledijo robu pobočja."),
("Bonito sometimes push bait up to the plume edge.","Palamide ponekad dotjeraju sitnu ribu do ruba riječne vode.","Palamide včasih priženejo drobno ribo do roba rečne vode."),
