("gof","Seriola dumerili","Seriola dumerili"),
("Gof sit deeper on the rocks and wrecks; jig them slowly.","Gofovi stoje dublje na kamenju i olupinama; jigirajte polako.","Gofi stojijo globlje na skalah in razbitinah; jigirajte počasi."),
("Moving water bunches the bait, and gof hunt along the drop-offs.","Pokretna voda zbija sitnu ribu, a gofovi love uz padine.","Gibanje vode zbije drobno ribo, gofi pa lovijo ob strminah."),
("Gof spread out; look for them under floating objects and round buoys.","Gofovi se raštrkaju; tražite ih ispod plutajućih predmeta i oko bova.","Gofi se razpršijo; iščite jih pod plavajočimi predmeti in okoli boj."),
("Current on the points and drop-offs switches gof on.","Struja na rtovima i padinama aktivira gofove.","Tok na rtičih in strminah gofe aktivira."),
("Steep rocky points with current: gof push bait against the rocks here.","Strmi stjenoviti rtovi sa strujom: ovdje gofovi tjeraju sitnu ribu uz stijene.","Strmi skalnati rtiči s tokom: tu gofi podijo drobno ribo proti skalam."),
("Rocky drop-offs and isolated rocks are prime gof ground.","Stjenovite padine i usamljene hridi vrhunska su pozicija za gofa.","Skalnate strmine in osamljene čeri so odlično lovišče za gofa."),
("Gof patrol the shelf after bait schools, often round buoys, mussel farms and anything floating.","Gofovi obilaze plato za jatima sitne ribe, često oko bova, uzgajališta dagnji i svega što pluta.","Gofi patruljirajo po planoti za jatami drobne ribe, pogosto okoli boj, gojišč školjk in vsega, kar plava."),
("Wrecks and deeper rock hold the bigger gof.","Olupine i dublje kamenje drže veće gofove.","Razbitine in globlje skale skrivajo večje gofe."),
("Small gof hunt round the outer breakwater and moorings in late summer.","Mali gofovi krajem ljeta love oko vanjskog lukobrana i vezova.","Mali gofi pozno poleti lovijo okoli zunanjega valobrana in privezov."),
("Young gof follow bait along the plume edge and floating weed.","Mladi gofovi prate sitnu ribu uz rub riječne vode i plutajuće alge.","Mladi gofi sledijo drobni ribi ob robu rečne vode in plavajočih algah."),
("Minimum size 45 cm; up to 20% of the gof you keep (by weight) may be 25–45 cm.","Minimalna veličina 45 cm; do 20% zadržanih gofova (po masi) smije biti 25–45 cm.","Najmanjša velikost 45 cm; do 20% obdržanih gofov (po masi) je lahko 25–45 cm."),
("Garfish","Iglica","Iglica"),
("iglica","Belone belone","Belone belone"),
("Garfish stay out on the open surface away from the shallows.","Iglice ostaju na otvorenoj površini, daleko od plićaka.","Iglice ostajajo na odprtem površju, daleč od plitvin."),
("Rising water brings garfish schools close to points and harbour walls.","Plima dovodi jata iglica blizu rtova i lučkih zidova.","Plima pripelje jate iglic blizu rtičev in pristaniških zidov."),
("Garfish cruise the surface all along the shore.","Iglice krstare površinom duž cijele obale.","Iglice križarijo po površju vzdolž vse obale."),
("Garfish line up on the current seams and the plume edge to pick off small fry.","Iglice se poredaju na strujnim granicama i rubu riječne vode i hvataju mlađ.","Iglice se postavijo na meje tokov in rob rečne vode ter lovijo mladice."),
("The plume edge collects fry and plankton: a top garfish line.","Rub riječne vode skuplja mlađ i plankton: vrhunska linija za iglicu.","Rob rečne vode zbira mladice in plankton: odlična linija za iglico."),
("Garfish schools swing past points on the moving tide.","Jata iglica prolaze pokraj rtova dok se voda kreće.","Jate iglic ob premikanju vode plavajo mimo rtičev."),
("Garfish cruise the surface close to rocky shore, especially in spring and autumn.","Iglice krstare površinom uz stjenovitu obalu, osobito u proljeće i jesen.","Iglice križarijo po površju ob skalnati obali, zlasti spomladi in jeseni."),
("Garfish hunt fry round harbour walls and breakwater tips.","Iglice love mlađ oko lučkih zidova i vrhova lukobrana.","Iglice lovijo mladice okoli pristaniških zidov in konic valobranov."),
("Schools roam the surface in open water; look for small fish skipping.","Jata lutaju površinom otvorenog mora; tražite sitnu ribu koja iskače.","Jate se potikajo po površju odprtega morja; iščite drobne ribe, ki poskakujejo."),
("Garfish feed on fry pushed out of the Mirna on the ebb.","Iglice se za oseke hrane mlađi koju izbacuje Mirna.","Iglice se ob oseki hranijo z mladicami, ki jih odplavlja Mirna."),
("No minimum size in Croatia. A favourite live bait for leerfish.","U Hrvatskoj nema minimalne veličine. Omiljeni živi mamac za licu.","Na Hrvaškem ni najmanjše velikosti. Priljubljena živa vaba za lico."),
("Orada","Orada","Orada"),
("gilthead bream","Sparus aurata","Sparus aurata"),
("Orada drop back to the channels and the edge of the bay.","Orade se povlače u kanale i na rub uvale.","Orade se umaknejo v kanale in na rob zaliva."),
("Orada push into shallow bays, flats and the river mouth as the tide rises. The best stage.","Orade za plime ulaze u plitke uvale, plićake i ušće. Najbolja faza.","Orade ob plimi vstopajo v plitve zalive, plitvine in ustje. Najboljša faza."),
("Orada feed right up in the shallows and along walls.","Orade se hrane sasvim u plićaku i uz zidove.","Orade se hranijo čisto v plitvini in ob zidovih."),
("Orada slide back out, feeding along the edges.","Orade se vraćaju van, hraneći se uz rubove.","Orade se vračajo ven in se hranijo ob robovih."),
("Orada gather at the Mirna mouth in autumn, feeding on mussels and crabs in the brackish water.","Orade se u jesen okupljaju na ušću Mirne i hrane dagnjama i rakovima u bočatoj vodi.","Orade se jeseni zbirajo na ustju Mirne in se v brakični vodi hranijo s školjkami in raki."),
("Orada graze sand and mud for shellfish and worms as the tide comes in.","Orade za plime pretražuju pijesak i mulj tražeći školjke i crve.","Orade ob plimi brskajo po pesku in mulju za školjkami in črvi."),
("Mussels on harbour and marina walls draw orada right in.","Dagnje na zidovima luke i marine privlače orade sasvim blizu.","Školjke na zidovih pristanišča in marine privabijo orade čisto blizu."),
("Orada cruise close in over sand and weed, often in 1–3 m.","Orade krstare blizu obale iznad pijeska i alga, često na 1–3 m.","Orade križarijo blizu obale nad peskom in algami, pogosto na 1–3 m."),
("Orada visit rocky points to crush mussels and small crabs.","Orade obilaze stjenovite rtove da drobe dagnje i male rakove.","Orade obiskujejo skalnate rtiče, da drobijo školjke in male rake."),
("Orada pick up food carried along the plume edge.","Orade skupljaju hranu koju nosi rub riječne vode.","Orade pobirajo hrano, ki jo nosi rob rečne vode."),
("Minimum size 20 cm.","Minimalna veličina 20 cm.","Najmanjša velikost 20 cm."),
