("Fratar feed along rocky shore, especially at dawn, dusk and night.","Fratri se hrane uz stjenovitu obalu, osobito u zoru, sumrak i noću.","Šargi se hranijo ob skalnati obali, zlasti ob zori, mraku in ponoči."),
